      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.27,
          "end": 2.4,
          "en": "Now, if you decide to follow along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 5.19,
          "en": "and you wanna learn more about this Pages Router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.19,
          "end": 7.77,
          "en": "you'll need a new project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.77,
          "end": 9.45,
          "en": "And for that, of course, you can take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.45,
          "end": 11.31,
          "en": "at the official documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.31,
          "end": 15,
          "en": "and you'll see that the command for creating such a project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 18.33,
          "en": "is the same as we used for building a project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.33,
          "end": 20.22,
          "en": "with the App Router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.22,
          "end": 24.723,
          "en": "It's this npx create-next-app command here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.83,
          "end": 28.56,
          "en": "So you can copy this command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.56,
          "end": 31.86,
          "en": "and execute it in your terminal or command prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.86,
          "end": 35.16,
          "en": "Just make sure you are navigated into a folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.16,
          "end": 37.593,
          "en": "where you wanna create that project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.55,
          "end": 39.84,
          "en": "If you then hit Enter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.84,
          "end": 42.63,
          "en": "you will again be asked some questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.63,
          "end": 44.64,
          "en": "For example, to choose a name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.64,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "And here, I'll name it nextjs-essentials-pages-router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.15,
          "end": 50.673,
          "en": "though the project name of course is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.96,
          "end": 54.3,
          "en": "Then you get asked a couple of questions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.3,
          "end": 57.15,
          "en": "and I'll choose No for TypeScript and ESLint,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.15,
          "end": 61.14,
          "en": "no for Tailwind, and no for this alternative directory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.14,
          "end": 63.75,
          "en": "But then we get an important question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.75,
          "end": 67.35,
          "en": "whether we wanna use the App Router, which is recommended.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.35,
          "end": 69.53999999999999,
          "en": "But of course, now the answer is no,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.53999999999999,
          "end": 72.453,
          "en": "because now we wanna learn about this alternative.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.5,
          "end": 74.76,
          "en": "So I'll choose no",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.76,
          "end": 77.64,
          "en": "and choose no for the last question I'm getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.64,
          "end": 80.373,
          "en": "And with that, a new project is created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 86.33,
          "en": "a project which when opened should look something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.43,
          "end": 90.39,
          "en": "Now, the configuration files you're getting might differ",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.39,
          "end": 92.67,
          "en": "depending on when you are running the command,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.67,
          "end": 95.85,
          "en": "but you should have a pages folder, public folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.85,
          "end": 98.19,
          "en": "and a styles folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.19,
          "end": 100.38,
          "en": "And attached to this lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.38,
          "end": 103.71000000000001,
          "en": "you'll actually find a starting snapshot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.71000000000001,
          "end": 106.89,
          "en": "both a local and a CodeSandbox version,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.89,
          "end": 110.67,
          "en": "which you can use so that you have exactly the same setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.67,
          "end": 113.55,
          "en": "as I'll be using for the rest of this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.55,
          "end": 116.343,
          "en": "just to make sure that we're all on the same page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.17,
          "end": 120.03,
          "en": "And with that, we're there for now ready",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.03,
          "end": 122.97,
          "en": "to dive into this Pages Router approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.97,
          "end": 125.763,
